{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Their heart sank</b> — grew faint. The meaning is 'the heart's failing,' from the root of ויפג לבו (Genesis 45:26)."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The lemma in Lamentations 2:18 is לב פוגת, but Ibn Ezra's gloss defines it through the parallel root in Genesis; rendered accordingly."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:41.998786264Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}